<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφοειδής</span>
			, like a cloud, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cloudy, bringing clouds,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ νότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					942a35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the voice,
				<i>husky,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				800a14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
